"Hello {{borrower_name}},\n"
"\n"
"the equipment for {{rental_number}} has been handed out.\n"
"\n"
"Return by: {{date_to}}\n"
"\n"
"Items:\n"
"{{items}}\n"
"\n"
"Best regards\n"
"{{site_name}}"
