msgid "When equipment is handed out or returned, the members involved get an email with each other’s contact details (name, email, phone if set in the profile) so they can arrange the hand-over: owner and borrower of a loan within a collective, and the owners of the equipment plus whoever set up an external rental. Needs email notifications to be on."
